<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of New York said a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of New York said a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities initiated coverage of the Bank of New York Co Inc with a buy rating on Tuesday, according to a Prudential source.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Monday at 34-5/8.</p>
</text>
